                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>.—No interest can be allowed except in
                    accordance with the bond of indemnity which authorized interest on the monthly
                    advance payments made within the half-year Period. The monthly installments of
                    August 1, September 1 and October 1 were paid October 1 and 10; hence interest
                    is allowed on the amount of said installments from date of payment to the end of
                    the year. The other payments in October are treated as payments of the monthly
                    installments of November 1 and December 1; hence interest is allowed from
                    November 1 and December 1, respectively: the dates the monthly installments earn
                    interest under the terms of the bond.</p>
